# Day 26 - Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator

## Objective
Built an interactive Prior Authorization Workflow Simulator to understand the healthcare insurance approval process.

## Features
- Patient workflow simulation
- Drag-and-drop workflow stages
- Document submission
- Approval, Pending, Denial & Appeal scenarios
- Journey Tracker
- Workflow Summary

## Learnings
